---
description: Unreal C++ conventions and architecture
globs: "**/*.{h,cpp,cs}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Follow Epic Unreal C++ conventions and `GOV-003`.
- Project prefix is `Akbal` after Unreal type prefix.
- Stable gameplay rules belong in C++; content assembly/tuning belongs in Blueprint/Data Assets.
- Keep implementation details Private; expose Public headers only when needed by another domain/module.
- Timing-critical rhythm logic must use the musical conductor contract, not frame/widget timing.
- Single-player: do not add networking/RPC architecture.
